WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:13.079
Tina: I did it, I did it!

2
00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:16.541
Ha! If only Danny and Brad could see me now!

3
00:00:16.561 --> 00:00:19.343
Tina: Hopian!

4
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:21.225
Hopian! It's me, Tina!

5
00:00:21.245 --> 00:00:26.348
Tina: It's you, it's you!

6
00:00:26.428 --> 00:00:28.229
I'm so happy to see you!

7
00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:30.791
Bello: Tina?

8
00:00:31.271 --> 00:00:31.952
Is that you?

9
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.060
Tina: Of course it's me!

10
00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.681
Don't you remember me?

11
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:40.224
Bello: I haven't forgotten, Tina, even though it was [n3@a long time ago.

12
00:00:40.944 --> 00:00:41.604
Come inside.

13
00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:44.846
Tina: What do you mean "a long time"?

14
00:00:45.807 --> 00:00:47.207
It wasn't that long ago.

15
00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:52.070
Bello: Tina, time works differently in my world than it does in yours.

16
00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.852
Tina: But you recognize me, don't you, Hopian?

17
00:00:55.872 --> 00:00:59.134
Bello: Tina, I'm not Hopian.

18
00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:00.335
I'm Bello.

19
00:01:00.355 --> 00:01:02.576
Tina: Bello?

20
00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:03.989
You're little Bello?

21
00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:06.411
Bello: I'm not so little anymore.

22
00:01:06.431 --> 00:01:08.992
Tina: You look exactly like your dad!

23
00:01:09.012 --> 00:01:16.218
Hopian: Well, not exactly like his dad.

24
00:01:17.018 --> 00:01:18.099
Hello, Tina.

25
00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:20.841
Tina: Hopian, it's you!

26
00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:23.943
Hopian: Be careful!

27
00:01:24.424 --> 00:01:26.545
I'm not as young as I used to be.

28
00:01:26.565 --> 00:01:30.208
Tina: But I don't understand.

29
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.362
It's only been a week since I saw you.

30
00:01:33.382 --> 00:01:36.525
Bello: I tried to explain it to her, Dad.

31
00:01:38.166 --> 00:01:40.208
Hopian: Tina, have a seat.

32
00:01:40.228 --> 00:01:43.731
Hopian: It's been fifteen years since you left.

33
00:01:43.751 --> 00:01:47.674
Bello: And they have been fifteen happy years for Ginormous.

34
00:01:47.694 --> 00:01:49.776
Hopian: That's right.

35
00:01:50.516 --> 00:01:55.320
Your deeds and your friends' deeds [n3@have not been forgotten.

36
00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:59.724
Tina: So, Hopian, you're old?

37
00:02:00.888 --> 00:02:01.869
Hopian: Yes, Tina.

38
00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:03.590
I'm old now.

39
00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:05.811
Tina: But I need your help.

40
00:02:06.531 --> 00:02:08.372
You have to come back to my world.

41
00:02:08.392 --> 00:02:11.874
Hopian: Why, what's the problem?

42
00:02:11.894 --> 00:02:14.135
Tina: You have to help Danny.

43
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:16.657
Hopian: Is Danny in trouble?

44
00:02:16.677 --> 00:02:20.599
Tina: It's terrible!

45
00:02:20.919 --> 00:02:22.059
Danny is full of hate.

46
00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.301
Tina: It's because of some bullies.

47
00:02:25.061 --> 00:02:26.262
They always pick on him.

48
00:02:26.282 --> 00:02:30.204
Tina: Now, Danny wants revenge, and he convinced Brad to help.

49
00:02:31.328 --> 00:02:32.869
Bello: That doesn't sound good.

50
00:02:32.889 --> 00:02:35.531
Tina: Danny won't listen to me.

51
00:02:36.392 --> 00:02:38.774
I'm worried that he will become like Tristay!

52
00:02:38.794 --> 00:02:44.198
Tina: I saw him cry black tears, just like Tristay did when he turned evil.

53
00:02:44.218 --> 00:02:48.462
Hopian: Black tears?

54
00:02:49.363 --> 00:02:51.744
Danny had black tears?

55
00:02:51.764 --> 00:02:54.547
Tina: You have to come with me, Hopian.

56
00:02:54.787 --> 00:02:55.588
You have to.

57
00:02:55.608 --> 00:03:00.912
Hopian: I would like to, Tina.

58
00:03:01.792 --> 00:03:05.755
But I'm too old for an adventure like that.

59
00:03:05.775 --> 00:03:08.898
Bello: Tina, Dad's old now.

60
00:03:09.638 --> 00:03:11.460
He's not as healthy as he used to be.

61
00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.762
Tina: But what what am I going to do?

62
00:03:14.782 --> 00:03:18.225
Bello: I think I know someone who can help.

63
00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:20.367
Tina: Really?

64
00:03:20.387 --> 00:03:20.467
Who?
